      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly CX review per VS-13
Frequency: Monthly analysis; the quarterly comprehensive review runs via the VS-13 quarterly CX cycle
Volume: ~2,000–3,000 feedback items/month
Owner: Customer Experience Manager
Participants: CX Manager, COO
Source: workflow W2162 — Gift Card Customer Satisfaction Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
