    <bpmn:process id="W_W5511" name="W5511. Gift Card Dormancy Monitoring, Escheat Evaluation &amp; Expired-Liability Derecognition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Stored-value dormancy sweep flags balances with 24 months of inactivity (no load, redemption, balance inquiry, or transfer)
Frequency: Quarterly dormancy sweep; annual escheat evaluation &amp; derecognition cycle
Volume: ~4,000–6,600 balances flagged dormant per annual cycle; aggregate dormant value ~PHP 8–12M
Owner: Finance Manager
Participants: Finance Manager, Accountant (AP/AR), Legal Counsel, Customer Service Manager
Source: workflow W5511 — Gift Card Dormancy Monitoring, Escheat Evaluation &amp; Expired-Liability Derecognition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5511_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5511_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5511_Lane2" name="Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5511_Lane3" name="Legal Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5511_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5511_Start5" name="Stored-value dormancy sweep flags balances with 24 months of inactivity (no load…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5511_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W5511_Task6" name="System flags stored-value balances with 24 months of inactivity per the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System flags stored-value balances with 24 months of inactivity per the quarterly dormancy sweep; generates the dormancy register (card number, balance, last activity, load channel)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5511_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5511_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5511_Task7" name="Accountant validates the dormancy register against redemptions, reissued cards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Accountant validates the dormancy register against redemptions, reissued cards, and pending disputes; queues customer outreach (SMS/email via loyalty contact data) giving 60 days to reactivate before the annual evaluation
Responsible (R): Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4 hours/sweep</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5511_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5511_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5511_Task8" name="Legal Counsel evaluates escheat applicability for unclaimed balances under…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal Counsel evaluates escheat applicability for unclaimed balances under Philippine unclaimed-property rules and, where applicable, prepares the filing through counsel; documents the position per dormant tranche
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5511_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5511_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5511_Task9" name="Finance derecognizes eligible expired liabilities to breakage income per the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Finance derecognizes eligible expired liabilities to breakage income per the PFRS 15 breakage policy (only where redemption is remote and the tranche passed the Legal evaluation); posts the GL entry and archives the dormancy register
Responsible (R): Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5511_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5511_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5511_Task10" name="Escheat filing executed where applicable; dormant-balance population, outreach…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Escheat filing executed where applicable; dormant-balance population, outreach evidence, derecognition entries, and filings archived for audit (feeds W2159 monthly reporting and the W2160 fraud-monitoring exclusions list)
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel / Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2 hours/cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5511_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5511_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5511_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5511_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5511_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-393 (ensure controlled execution — Gift Card Reconciliation &amp; Analytics (PA-54.3).) | - operational: Finance Manager review and approval gate; Legal Counsel sign-off before derecognition
Owner: Finance Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
